      "id": "claim_9419b00164584e85bebb18f911060cbc",
      "statement": "A new inbound message replaces an active turn in the same conversation: Talon cancels it, recovers the latest checkpoint where possible, and uses generations to prevent the cancelled turn from delivering stale output; separate conversations can run concurrently.",
